'''Crown of the Tyrant''' is a [[unique]] {{il|Magistrate Crown}}.

==Mechanics==
{{c|mod|You and Nearby Allies have # to # added X Damage per Y Socket}}: Allies can be affected by a single instance of added damage of each damage type; multiple copies of the same aura effect do not stack.

{{c|mod|Nearby Enemies have -10% to all Resistances}}: This aura does not stack; enemies can only be affected by one instance of the Crown of the Tyrant debuff. 

{{c|mod|Has 1 Socket}}: Once the socket colour on Crown of the Tyrant has been changed, the only way to change its socket colour back to white is to use the [[crafting bench]] recipe that sets all socket colours to white. All other crafting bench recipes and currencies that change colours guarantee a non-white socket.

